{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "hub-center",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# \ud83c\udf10 CV Projects Knowledge Hub & Spatial Map\n\nWelcome to the **Computer Vision & Perception Knowledge Vault**.\n\n### \ud83d\udcca Vault Dimensions\n- **20 Perception & Robotics Domains** (`topics/`)\n- **98 Central Architecture References** (`architectures/`)\n- **20 Hardware Target Platforms** (`hardware/`)\n- **18 Acceleration Frameworks** (`frameworks/`)\n- **24 Production-Grade Cookbooks** (`cookbooks/`)\n\n*Click any card or link below to navigate directly into deep-dive playbooks and runnable recipes.*",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 520,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "grp-mocs",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "Central Navigation Indexes (MOCs)",
      "x": -720,
      "y": -360,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 720,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "moc-arch",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Model Architectures MOC\n**[[architectures/00-architectures-moc|Open Architectures Index \u2197]]**\n- **98 SOTA Architectures** indexed with YAML metadata\n- Detectors, Segmenters, Transformers, SSMs & VLMs\n- Verified commercial licenses (Apache-2.0, MIT, BSD)",
      "x": -680,
      "y": -300,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "moc-hw",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \u26a1 Hardware Targets MOC\n**[[hardware/00-hardware-moc|Open Hardware Targets Index \u2197]]**\n- **20 Silicon Platforms**: NVIDIA Blackwell, Jetson Orin/Thor, AMD Versal Gen 2, ARM Cortex-R52, Loihi 2\n- Compute specs, TOPS/W, memory bandwidth, ASIL safety tiers",
      "x": -680,
      "y": -140,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "moc-fw",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Acceleration Frameworks MOC\n**[[frameworks/00-frameworks-moc|Open Frameworks Index \u2197]]**\n- **18 Runtime Frameworks**: TensorRT 10, ONNX Runtime, Vulkan SC 2.0, AMD Quark, Iceoryx2, Zenoh\n- Zero-copy IPC, execution providers, and ISO 26262 runtimes",
      "x": -680,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "moc-cookbooks",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83c\udf73 Runnable Cookbooks MOC\n**[[cookbooks/00-cookbooks-moc|Open Cookbooks Catalog \u2197]]**\n- **24 Complete Recipes** with standalone Python/Rust code\n- Mathematical derivations, Mermaid flows, and hardware benchmarks\n- Shared sensor primitives in `cookbooks/common/`",
      "x": -680,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "grp-perception",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "Core 2D/3D Perception & Tracking Domains",
      "x": 640,
      "y": -480,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 960,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "topic-det",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83c\udfaf 1. Object Detection\n**[[topics/object-detection/00-object-detection-moc|Detection Domain MOC \u2197]]**\n- **SOTA**: RF-DETR, RT-DETRv3, YOLOv10-26, Grounding DINO\n- **Playbook**: [[topics/object-detection/README|Detection Production Guide]]\n- **Key Metric**: 56.9 mAP @ 1.15 ms (TensorRT FP16)",
      "x": 680,
      "y": -420,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "topic-seg",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udd8c\ufe0f 2. Object Segmentation\n**[[topics/object-segmentation/00-object-segmentation-moc|Segmentation Domain MOC \u2197]]**\n- **SOTA**: SAM 2.1, Depth Anything V2, Mask2Former\n- **Playbook**: [[topics/object-segmentation/README|Segmentation Production Guide]]\n- **Key Metric**: 44 FPS live video mask streaming (SAM 2)",
      "x": 680,
      "y": -270,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "topic-track",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83c\udfc3 3. Video Tracking\n**[[topics/video-tracking/00-video-tracking-moc|Tracking Domain MOC \u2197]]**\n- **SOTA**: ByteTrack, BoT-SORT, CoTracker3\n- **Playbook**: [[topics/video-tracking/README|Video Tracking Production Guide]]\n- **Key Metric**: 80.3 MOTA @ 0.35 ms association latency",
      "x": 680,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "topic-6dof",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udcd0 4. 6-DoF Pose Estimation\n**[[topics/6dof-pose-estimation/00-6dof-pose-estimation-moc|6-DoF Pose MOC \u2197]]**\n- **SOTA**: FoundationPose, MegaPose, EPnP Analytical Solver\n- **Playbook**: [[topics/6dof-pose-estimation/README|6-DoF Pose Production Guide]]\n- **Key Metric**: 0.18 ms pose recovery (O(n) SVD kernel)",
      "x": 680,
      "y": 30,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "topic-lidar",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \u2601\ufe0f 5. LiDAR 3D Perception\n**[[topics/lidar-perception/00-lidar-perception-moc|LiDAR Domain MOC \u2197]]**\n- **SOTA**: DSVT, FlatFormer, PointPillars, CenterPoint\n- **Playbook**: [[topics/lidar-perception/README|LiDAR Production Guide]]\n- **Key Metric**: 78.9% mAP @ 27.0 ms on nuScenes LiDAR",
      "x": 680,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "topic-fusion",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83d\udd00 6. Multi-Modal Sensor Fusion\n**[[topics/sensor-fusion/00-sensor-fusion-moc|Sensor Fusion MOC \u2197]]**\n- **SOTA**: MIT BEVFusion, Sparse4D v3, UniAD\n- **Playbook**: [[topics/sensor-fusion/README|Sensor Fusion Production Guide]]\n- **Key Metric**: 72.9% NDS @ 41.0 ms Camera-LiDAR BEV",
      "x": 680,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "5"
    },
