    {
      "id": "card-gpu",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \ud83d\ude80 GPU Deployment (CUDA & TensorRT)\n**[[topics/gpu-deployment/00-gpu-deployment-moc|GPU Deployment MOC \u2197]]**\n- **Engines**: TensorRT 10 FP8/FP16, CUDA Graphs, Zero-Copy Host Pinned Memory\n- **Guide**: [[topics/gpu-deployment/README|GPU Production Deployment Playbook]]",
