      "type": "text",
      "text": "### \u26a1 FPGA & Edge Acceleration\n**[[topics/fpga-deployment/00-fpga-deployment-moc|FPGA Deployment MOC \u2197]]**\n- **Frameworks**: AMD Quark PTQ (AWQ/SmoothQuant), Xilinx Vitis AI, FINN QNNs\n- **Guide**: [[topics/fpga-deployment/README|FPGA Hardware Synthesis Playbook]]",
