      "text": "### \u23f1\ufe0f Microsecond Real-Time Systems\n**[[topics/real-time-systems/00-real-time-systems-moc|Real-Time Systems MOC \u2197]]**\n- **Stack**: Linux PREEMPT_RT, POSIX shm, Iceoryx2, Zenoh, RMS/EDF Scheduling\n- **Guide**: [[topics/real-time-systems/README|Hard Real-Time Systems Playbook]]",
      "x": -310,
